                    <b>Author</b>: Izumi TSUBAKI<br>                    <b>Artist</b>: Izumi TSUBAKI<br>                    <b>Synopsis</b>: One day a salaryman spots a high school girl eating convenience store bread all alone on a park bench. Day after day he sits on the bench next to her to quietly keep her company. Little does he realize…            </div>
